    <briefdescription>
<para>Represents a point in a spatial tree with a specific depth. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Extends <ref refid="class_point_map" kindref="compound">PointMap</ref> by adding the depth of the point in a spatial tree structure. This class is used to locate cells in hierarchical spatial trees for efficient terrain and landscape management. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
